(text "24 V arrives from the panel XT90 and 7 A breaker on J1. The plug-in power module (PM1) carries the TPS2663 eFuse and the TPS7A4901." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ec5738a0-e1cd-42f6-aacc-da8ee3b626b9))
(text "PM1 returns protected +24V, and makes +5VA (analog 5 V) from +12V. Its eFuse fault and current-monitor outputs go to the expander and ADC #2." (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a5468914-d295-44b0-8d48-36cea2dfefa6))
(text "Pololu D24V22Fx pinout confirmed from the board: PG, EN, VIN, GND, VOUT (1-5) plus a corner GND (6). EN and PG unused." (at 20.32 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid df17878f-27db-4a12-a242-246a1fa2b7a0))
(text "LM1117: tantalum (or ESR-specified) 10 uF on input and output, per the TI datasheet." (at 20.32 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 521a1e96-2983-438e-91fe-56df93cfe6d3))
(text "+24V_FIELD feeds limit switches, the orifice selector and the E-stop status contact, through a 0.1 A PTC." (at 20.32 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 965b389f-4558-4ede-9f31-fe563304561e))
